00:35:55.985 --> 00:35:58.738
and the ninth interrupt the action
and calm him down.

00:35:58.779 --> 00:36:02.491
Ninth whips out her phone and shows
evidence of the detective promising

00:36:02.491 --> 00:36:05.620
to give her police information
to keep her safe.

00:36:05.661 --> 00:36:10.041
Hearing this, the detective's assistant
formally places the fourth under arrest,

00:36:10.041 --> 00:36:12.418
and they tell him
that his wife and kids are safe.

00:36:12.418 --> 00:36:14.462
So the detective decides to spare them

00:36:14.462 --> 00:36:16.923
the trouble and breaks his phone,
eliminating him

00:36:16.923 --> 00:36:19.425
from the game
and disappears into thin air.

00:36:19.467 --> 00:36:22.428
After the incident,
Yuki and Yuno names are cleared

00:36:22.428 --> 00:36:24.847
and they no longer
have to worry about the police.

00:36:24.889 --> 00:36:29.226
Luckily for Yuki, that cop was pretty
damn strong and survived the gunshot.

00:36:29.268 --> 00:36:32.730
The couple then decides to go on a day
trip and waits for the train to visit.

00:36:32.730 --> 00:36:33.564
Yuki is dead.

00:36:33.564 --> 00:36:34.899
That's when suddenly Yuki here

00:36:34.899 --> 00:36:38.069
gets a text from Aki, say,
telling him to stay away from, Yuno

00:36:38.069 --> 00:36:40.863
the police are following her
for unknown reasons

00:36:40.863 --> 00:36:42.657
and that he should keep his distance.

00:36:42.657 --> 00:36:45.534
However, Yuno,
here is the one reading the text

00:36:45.534 --> 00:36:50.665
and she deletes the message before he
comes back and they then board the train.

